{"id": "bulla-3", "symbol": "bulla", "name": "BULLA", "web_slug": "bulla-3", "asset_platform_id": "binance-smart-chain", "platforms": {"binance-smart-chain": "0x595e21b20e78674f8a64c1566a20b2b316bc3511"}, "detail_platforms": {"binance-smart-chain": {"decimal_place": 18, "contract_address": "0x595e21b20e78674f8a64c1566a20b2b316bc3511", "geckoterminal_url": "https://www.geckoterminal.com/bsc/tokens/0x595e21b20e78674f8a64c1566a20b2b316bc3511"}}, "block_time_in_minutes": 0, "hashing_algorithm": null, "categories": ["BNB Chain Ecosystem", "Meme", "Parody Meme", "Celebrity-Themed", "Binance Alpha Spotlight"], "preview_listing": false, "public_notice": null, "additional_notices": [], "description": {"en": "$BULLA contributes to the crypto industry by expanding adoption through culturally relevant and accessible entry points. The project provides use cases through token-based gamification, interactive quests, gated content access, and participation in community-driven campaigns. Web3 is much more useful when friend groups are onboarded together. Hasbulla is trying to use his fame to do that.\n\nHasbulla comes from a minority population in a minority state in Russia. His people are sick of financial oppression.  He understands the value of web3 and store of value in crypto and is using his fame to educate corners of the world untouched by web3.\n\nThe value of the project lies in its ability to engage a broad audience that may not be familiar with blockchain, using entertainment and recognizable figures to encourage participation. It supports ecosystem growth by increasing wallet activity, driving on-chain interactions, and creating meaningful use cases for meme tokens.\n\nIn other industries, such as entertainment and media, $BULLA introduces a new model for audience engagement, allowing fans to interact with content, personalities, and digital assets in a tokenized environment.\n"}, "links": {"homepage": ["https://bullamascot.io/"], "whitepaper": "", "blockchain_site": ["h